[en.IDEA_C12_CONTROL_ROCK_FARM]
Control Rock Farm

[en.IDEA_C12_CONTROL_ROCK_FARM_desc]
We successfully gained control of the rock farm through our specialized machinery. We will turn the farm into our primary source of raw materials and sell our goods to their ponies.

[zh.IDEA_C12_CONTROL_ROCK_FARM]
控制采石农场

[zh.IDEA_C12_CONTROL_ROCK_FARM_desc]
我们成功通过我们的特制机器掌控了采石农场，我们将让农场变成我们的原料采集地并向他们的小马倾销我们的商品。
